      { "str": "Figure 4:", "x": 108, "y": 510.09, "width": 37.04 },
      { "str": " ", "x": 145.04, "y": 510.09, "width": 3.26 },
      {
        "str": "Visualization of comparisons with baselines.",
        "x": 148.36,
        "y": 510.09,
        "width": 191.01
      },
      { "str": " ", "x": 339.38, "y": 510.09, "width": 3.37 },
      {
        "str": "The large view on top denotes the input",
        "x": 342.81,
        "y": 510.09,
        "width": 161.19
      },
      {
        "str": "view, while the two smaller views below show novel views generated by each method.",
        "x": 107.75,
        "y": 499.13,
        "width": 343.85
      },
      {
        "str": "loss supplies the 3D structural signal that 2D objectives cannot, validating it as a key component of",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 477.14,
        "width": 396
      },
      { "str": "PixWorld.", "x": 108, "y": 466.18, "width": 40.44 },
      { "str": "", "x": 108.3, "y": 437.12, "width": 0 },
      { "str": "5", "x": 108.3, "y": 437.12, "width": 5.98 },
      { "str": " ", "x": 114.28, "y": 437.12, "width": 12.55 },
      { "str": "C", "x": 126.83, "y": 437.12, "width": 7.97 },
      { "str": "ONCLUSION", "x": 135.4, "y": 437.12, "width": 59.98 },
      { "str": "", "x": 107.53, "y": 413.36, "width": 0 },
      {
        "str": "We present PixWorld, an end-to-end pixel-space diffusion framework that unifies 3D scene generation",
        "x": 107.53,
        "y": 413.36,
        "width": 396.47
      },
      {
        "str": "and reconstruction in a single model by partitioning multi-view inputs into clean and noisy subsets",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 402.4,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "and producing a pixel-aligned 3D Gaussian representation in one forward pass. Eliminating the",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 391.44,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "intermediate VAE/RAE stage avoids the information loss and extra training cost of latent autoencoders,",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 380.48,
        "width": 397.24
      },
      {
        "str": "and lets the diffusion objective directly supervise the 3D representation through differentiable",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 369.52,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "rendering rather than an intermediate latent target; to further enforce 3D structural consistency",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 358.57,
        "width": 396.34
      },
      {
        "str": "beyond 2D photometric and perceptual losses, a geometry perception loss aligns rendered and ground-",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 347.61,
        "width": 397.65
      },
      {
        "str": "truth views in the geometry-aware feature space of a pretrained 3D foundation model. These results",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 336.65,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "suggest that pixel-space diffusion, by removing latent indirection and naturally unifying generation",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 325.69,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "with reconstruction, marks a promising paradigm toward scalable and unified 3D scene modeling.",
        "x": 107.64,
        "y": 314.73,
        "width": 389.8
      },
      { "str": "", "x": 108.3, "y": 285.67, "width": 0 },
      { "str": "R", "x": 108.3, "y": 285.67, "width": 7.97 },
      { "str": "EFERENCES", "x": 116.87, "y": 285.67, "width": 58.39 },
